<title>
High Pressure Fuel Pump Inspection
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0A1716010">High Pressure Fuel Pump Removal and Installation:K14C</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Check the following points.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Fuel passages for inlet (1) with mesh filter and outlet (2) are clean.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Plunger (3) does not wobble.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
High pressure fuel pump tappet (4) is not badly worn and roller (5) rotates smoothly.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFAE0A170030.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "53.900mm" ver = "01" gw = "185" gh = "136"/>
